          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y-12&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{y}{\\frac{1}{2}}-\\frac{12}{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)\\\\y-12&=\\frac{1}{2}(2y-24)\\end{align*}$$",
