          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\pi x+3&=\\pi\\left(\\frac{\\pi x}{\\pi}+\\frac{3}{\\pi}\\right)\\\\\\pi x+3&=\\pi\\left(x+\\frac{3}{\\pi}\\right)\\end{align*}$$",
